## DC 1 — Company and Services

### Edit 1 ⚠️ (finding 13 + new) — opening sentence is too narrow

**Current**

> Normain AB (Sweden) provides an AI-powered automation platform that integrates with customer file storage to automate tasks, analyze data, and generate actionable insights.

**Proposed**

> Normain AB (Sweden) provides an AI-powered automation platform that ingests customer content from connected file storage (SharePoint, Google Drive, Box), direct uploads, and customer-provided URLs, and uses AI to extract insights and generate outputs.

**Why:** `src/shared/dataSources/src/index.ts` accepts three reference types — `uploadedFileReference`, `entry` (connected file storage), and `url` (web content via Firecrawl). The current sentence covers only the second.

