## DC 3.5 — Third-Party Access — Production Data Path

### Edit 5 🔴 (findings 13 + 35) — multiple subprocessor rows are wrong

The current table lists OpenAI and Anthropic as production-data-path subprocessors and includes Sentry. Code/IaC shows:

- **Sentry** — no `@sentry/*` dependency in any `package.json`, no `Sentry.init`, no `SENTRY_DSN` in IaC. Not present.
- **OpenAI / Anthropic** — all production LLM and embedding traffic routes through `azurerm_cognitive_account` (Azure OpenAI Service) — see `terraform/environments/app-production/infra/main.tf` and `src/shared/ai/ai.groups/src/index.ts`. `OPENAI_API_KEY` and `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` are not set in production IaC; the Anthropic agent path is gated on `if (ANTHROPIC_API_KEY)` (`src/apps/server/worker/src/extractInsightWorker/ExtractInsightWorker.ts`).
- **Firecrawl** — used to scrape customer-provided URLs (`src/apps/server/worker/src/dataSourceIndexing/ScrapeUrlDataSourceWorker.ts`) and as an agent tool (`src/.../anthropicExtractInsightAgent/tools.ts`). `FIRECRAWL__API_KEY` is a production secret. Missing from the current table.

**Current**

| Vendor | Role |
|---|---|
| Microsoft Azure | Primary cloud infrastructure (sole carved-out subservice organization). |
| Sentry | Application error and performance monitoring. |
| PostHog | Product analytics. |
| OpenAI | Large-language-model provider (per-feature, customer-opt-in). |
| Anthropic | Large-language-model provider (per-feature, customer-opt-in). |
| BetterStack | Uptime monitoring and log aggregation. |

**Proposed**

| Vendor | Role |
|---|---|
| Microsoft Azure | Primary cloud infrastructure (sole carved-out subservice organization). Includes Azure OpenAI Service, which is the sole LLM and embedding provider during the examination period. |
| PostHog | Product analytics (event telemetry). |
| BetterStack (Better Stack Inc.) | Log aggregation (OpenTelemetry ingestion) and uptime monitoring. |
| Firecrawl (Mendable AI Inc.) | Web fetching, search, and content extraction for customer-provided URL data sources. |

Add a paragraph below the table:

> Direct integrations with OpenAI and Anthropic are available as deferred capabilities but were not active during the examination period. Any future activation will be notified to customers as a subprocessor change under the DPA's 30-day notice (DC 2). Application error tracking via Sentry is not currently deployed.

